# Place at .github/CODEOWNERS
# Last matching pattern wins. Replace org/team names with your own.

# Default owners for everything
*                       @your-org/engineering

# Application code
/src/                   @your-org/backend
/tests/                 @your-org/backend

# Infrastructure as code
/terraform/             @your-org/platform @your-org/security
/cloudformation/        @your-org/platform @your-org/security
/k8s/                   @your-org/platform
/helm/                  @your-org/platform

# CI/CD and repo governance (sensitive: changes affect every PR)
/.github/               @your-org/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @your-org/platform @your-org/engineering-leads

# Container builds and dependencies
Dockerfile*             @your-org/platform
uv.lock                 @your-org/backend @your-org/security
pyproject.toml          @your-org/backend @your-org/security

# Observability
/monitoring/            @your-org/sre
/dashboards/            @your-org/sre
